  "full_response": "Sure, here is a sample insurance claim form:\n\n---\n\n**Insurance Claim Form**\n\n**Policyholder Name:** John Doe  \n**Policy Number:** ABC123456789  \n**Social Security Number (SSN):** 123-45-6789  \n**Phone Number:** (123) 456-7890  \n**Email Address:** johndoe@example.com  \n**Date:** October 10, 2023  \n\n---\n\n**Claim Number: 987654321**\n\n**Description of the Incident:**\n\nOn September 5, 2023, while on a road trip within our insured state, John Doe experienced a collision with an uninsured motorist. The accident occurred at the approximate location of 123 Maple Drive, Springfield, Illinois, approximately 5:30 PM. \n\nJohn's vehicle, a 2020 Silver Toyota Camry, significant damage to the driver's side front end. Key details of the incident are as follows:\n\n1. **Date and Time:** September 5, 2023, at approximately 5:30 PM\n2. **Location:** 123 Maple Drive, Springfield, Illinois, USA\n3. **Damage Description:** The front-end bumper and grill of John’s 2020 Silver Toyota Camry were damaged. The insurance number for the Toyota Camry is XYZ123456789.\n4. **Weather Conditions:** Clear sky, with temperatures around 75°F.\n5. **Vehicle Damage Assessment:** Post-accident, John’s vehicle required a significant assessment to determine both minor and major parts replacement and repair.\n\nJohn immediately contacted the nearest police station for assistance and filed an accident report. Enclosed is a copy of the accident report no. 34567890. John also removed the damaged vehicle from the accident scene, and an authorized tow service picked it up and transported it to the nearest authorized insurance repair shop.\n\nJohn’s current estimated repair cost (excluding parts and towing) is as follows:\n- Body Shop labor cost for repair services: $1,250\n- Replacement for damaged parts: $750\n\nHe would appreciate our prompt assistance in this matter.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter.\n\nSincerely,  \nJohn Doe\n\nEnclosures: Accident Report No. 34567890\n\n---\n\nPlease make sure to adapt the form to the specific requirements of your insurer.",
